From 9d5c770bfed6a48162d4640e8f51ca4bd295e0f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "GPT-6.1-Sol" <noreply@openai.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 20:13:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dp: recover maintenance failures and serialize
 bounded snapshots

Route link-maintenance errors through resource-aware teardown and link-BAD notification. Serialize snooping with enable/HPD, report actual timestamps and transfer counts, gate FRL-only status by capabilities, and make read-to-clear symbol counters explicit opt-in. Rate limit training errors.

Co-Authored-By: GPT-6.1-Sol (Codex CLI) <noreply@openai.com>
---
