 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_ctrl.h    |  2 +-
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_display.c | 86 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 3 files changed, 118 insertions(+), 53 deletions(-)

